===Etymology 1===
{{root|de|ine-pro|*bʰerǵʰ-}}
From {{inh|de|mhg|burc}}, from {{inh|de|goh|burg}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*burg}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*burgz}}, from {{der|de|ine-pro||*bʰérǵʰ-s}}, a form of {{inh|de|ine-pro|*bʰerǵʰ-||fortified elevation}}.

Compare {{cog|nl|burcht}}, {{cog|en|borough}}, {{m|en|-bury|&#8209;bury}}, {{cog|da|borg}}.

